  <section class="wrap features">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="text">
        <p class="eyebrow">READINESS</p>
        <h2>Wake up knowing<br>how hard to train.</h2>
        <p class="desc">A 0–100 readiness score on waking, based on your personal night-HRV and resting-heart-rate baselines and last night's recovery. It updates with you all day.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="media"><div class="phone"><img src="{{ '7HN3BWCNEWNFDBJ45ZDTEP8WW2-hd.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Readiness screen" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600"></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="row flip">
      <div class="text">
        <p class="eyebrow">SLEEP</p>
        <h2>One score.<br>Know how you slept.</h2>
        <p class="desc">Out of 100, weighted across seven sleep factors. Tap any factor to see why your score went up or down.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="media"><div class="phone"><img src="{{ '7YXYG9KPQVDK2RCXZ8G51A6X5D-hd.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Sleep screen" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600"></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="text">
        <p class="eyebrow">TRAINING LOAD</p>
        <h2>Daily movement and every workout<br>all count.</h2>
        <p class="desc">Heart-rate zones and activity are tallied every 5 minutes, never double-counting workouts. Your daily range follows last night's sleep, so you know how much is just right today.</p>
        <div class="stats">
          <div class="stat"><b>0–21</b><span>daily load</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><b>5</b><span>heart-rate zones</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><b>48</b><span>workout modes</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="media"><div class="phone"><img src="{{ '67WAPXHJRPA6Y3YEQ5E31GWT8M-hd.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Training load screen" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600"></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

